3018-10-20 15:58:00 INFO  ford-of-bruinen: party inbound. frodo carries a morgul shard (weathertop); escort is glorfindel on asfaloth
3018-10-20 16:00:00 INFO  ford-of-bruinen: riders approach (5 nazgul, 1 hobbit, 1 elf, 1 ranger, 1 horse)
3018-10-20 16:00:05 INFO  ford-of-bruinen: asfaloth crosses; the black horses will not. five riders wait on the far bank
3018-10-20 16:00:10 INFO  elrond: authorizes the river. command: "nuinin, mylnhin... rise"
